    "title": "Opening for Production Engineer at H.B. Fuller India",
    "description": "H.B. Fuller India has an exciting opening for a Production Engineer at our Allahabad office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout H.B. Fuller India:\nH.B. Fuller India is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Maintain accurate production records and prepare daily reports\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Allahabad, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with H.B. Fuller India!",
